---
// Dedicated About the Engineer Section
// Establishes identity, commercial engineering depth, and client market experience
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-theme hairline-b relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Header & Identity -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:sticky lg:top-28">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold">PROFILE</span>
          <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--text-muted)]">01 ABOUT THE ENGINEER</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-6 font-normal">
          Engineering software <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          beyond the UI.
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-8">
          Mohammed Nabil Shaikh <br />
          <span class="text-[var(--accent)]">Software Engineer · Full Stack Developer</span>
        </p>

        <!-- Markets Experience Signal -->
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] shadow-xs space-y-3">
          <div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--text-muted)] flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>MARKETS WORKED WITH</span>
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-center font-mono">
            <div class="py-2 px-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
              INDIA
            </div>
            <div class="py-2 px-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
              GULF
            </div>
            <div class="py-2 px-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
              US
            </div>
            <div class="py-2 px-3 rounded bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] border border-[var(--border)] text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">
              UK
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-tight pt-1">
            Hands-on client and product engineering experience across domestic and international markets.
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative & Architecture Focus -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-[var(--text-primary)] font-normal leading-relaxed">
          I'm <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Mohammed Nabil Shaikh</strong>, a Software Engineer from Mumbai focused on building practical, production-oriented software.
        </p>

        <p>
          My work spans full-stack web applications, SaaS products, backend systems, APIs, databases, business logic, AI-assisted workflows, performance optimization, and technical SEO.
        </p>

        <p>
          I've worked on real-world products and client projects across different markets, giving me experience translating business requirements into working software rather than simply implementing interfaces.
        </p>

        <p>
          I care about how systems behave beyond the UI — architecture, data flow, validation, authentication, business rules, performance, scalability, and the actual problem the software is solving.
        </p>

        <!-- Structured Technical Highlights -->
        <div class="pt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] space-y-1.5">
            <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">01 / BACKEND & LOGIC</div>
            <div class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">REST APIs, Auth Guard, Domain Rules</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans leading-normal">Deterministic validation, RBAC gatekeeping, collision prevention, atomic writes.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] space-y-1.5">
            <div class="text-[10px] text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">02 / FULL STACK SAAS</div>
            <div class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">Production MERN & Modern Web</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-[var(--text-muted)] font-sans leading-normal">Multi-tenant architecture, React state sync, Docker workflows, AI pipelines.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
          <a href="/resume" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-[var(--accent)] hover:opacity-90 text-white uppercase tracking-wider transition-opacity font-semibold">
            View Complete Resume
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-[var(--surface-subtle)] hover:bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] text-[var(--text-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors">
            Start a Technical Conversation →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
